import Standards.RFC.MD5
import Md5.Spec.Program

/-!
# `md-5` specification

Entry point for the specification of the `md-5` crate (library `md5`):

* `Standards.RFC.MD5`: the MD5 message-digest algorithm of RFC 1321;
* `Md5.Spec.Program.Extracted`: the compiled program, generated by `scripts/extract.py`;
* `Md5.Spec.Program`: call semantics of the 10 extracted entry points (valid calls, the slice
  tables, the output readers, and the preserved registers); the machine environment a call
  assumes is lean-x86's.

`Md5.Statements` may import only specification modules.
-/
